<title>SWEDEN: Trade halted in Orrefors - Sweden bourse.</title>
<headline>Trade halted in Orrefors - Sweden bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm Stock Exchange said on Friday trade was suspended in Swedish luxury glass maker Orrefors.</p>
<p>Further information was expected during the day, the Stock Exchange told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Swedish holding company Proventus said earlier on Friday it had bought 180,686 shares in Orrefors Kosta Boda, raising its stake in the company to 21.1 percent of capital and votes.</p>
<p>Swedish glass manufacturer Orrefors Kosta Boda and Denmark's porcelain, silver and glass producer Royal Copenhagen AS announced in July they would work together to improve distribution and boost sales in key export markets.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
